# FULL recode 
# Own websocket module which allows to implement a lot of new stuff 
# Decreased memory usage from 15mb (+ memory leak) to 7.5mb (excluding data objects and cache)
# All functions and most builders are moved into separated files and are loaded using function- and eventBuilder automatically
