# addIntents 33280 -> addIntents "Guilds" "GuildMembers" "GuildMessages" "MessageContent"
# interaction_reply "channel_message" ...
# New events system based on bashup.events:
# onMessageCreate helloWorld -> event on "messageCreate" helloWorld
# New data storage method: All event data is now stored inside ${data[]} array
# $data_onMessageCreate -> ${data[onMessageCreate]}
# Added support for new Discord events
# New error parsing (only available for builders ATM), e.g.:
# addSelectMenuOption: No label provided
# > addSelectMenuOption "${1}" "${2}" # marked as red "${3}" "${4}" "${5}" "${6}"
# Warning: addStatus: Value expected
# New variables which are automatically set on each event:
# $channel_id: event's channel ID
# $guild_id: event's guild ID
# $author: event's author object
# $author_id: event's author ID
# interaction_reply rework: 
